    "summary": "EU-wide rules from Regulation (EC) No 810/2009 (Visa Code). Covers 29 Schengen countries. Funds are per member state \u00e2\u20ac\u201d set destination_country (ISO alpha-2) in applicant_meta.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Regulation (EC) No 810/2009 \u00e2\u20ac\u201d Visa Code",
        "url": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/HTML/?uri=CELEX%3A32009R0810"
      },
      {
        "title": "Your Europe \u00e2\u20ac\u201d Travel documents for non-EU nationals",
