  "source_notes": [
    "Covers all 29 Schengen countries. Check if your nationality needs a visa at EU regulation 1806/2018.",
    "Passport: valid 3+ months beyond departure, issued within 10 years, 2 blank pages (Visa Code Art. 12).",
    "Insurance: \u00e2\u201a\u00ac30,000+ cover, emergency, hospitalisation, repatriation (Visa Code Art. 15).",
    "Funds: vary by member state. Defaults to Spain (\u00e2\u201a\u00ac122.10/day). Set destination_country for correct threshold.",
    "EES live since 10 April 2026 at all Schengen external borders."
  ],
